WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.590
- I know Kevin loves the
Philadelphia Eagles football team.

00:00:03.590 --> 00:00:04.423
- [Kevin] Yes.
- First of all,

00:00:04.423 --> 00:00:05.930
I know this because my nanny is obsessed

00:00:05.930 --> 00:00:07.470
with the Philadelphia football team.

00:00:07.470 --> 00:00:09.030
- Yes.
- She's one who told me.

00:00:09.030 --> 00:00:10.502
- We all saw him on the field,

00:00:10.502 --> 00:00:12.123
after they won the Super Bowl.

00:00:12.123 --> 00:00:12.956
- [Kevin] Yes!

00:00:12.956 --> 00:00:14.149
- [Kelly] We have some photos.

00:00:14.149 --> 00:00:14.982
- [Kevin] Well.

00:00:14.982 --> 00:00:17.530
- [Kelly] There's one player
celebrating with the trophy.

00:00:17.530 --> 00:00:18.413
And another, oh!

00:00:18.413 --> 00:00:19.246
(audience laughs)

00:00:19.246 --> 00:00:20.660
And here's where you are.

00:00:20.660 --> 00:00:22.370
- [Kevin] Yeah, yeah, yep.

00:00:22.370 --> 00:00:24.001
- Security would not let you up. (laughs)

00:00:24.001 --> 00:00:24.834
- Yeah, yeah.

00:00:24.834 --> 00:00:25.870
(audience laughing)

00:00:25.870 --> 00:00:27.550
- That was it, well I have a surprise.

00:00:27.550 --> 00:00:29.216
- I remember that.
- Do you wanna know what?

00:00:29.216 --> 00:00:30.049
I have a surprise.

00:00:30.049 --> 00:00:31.480
The eagles wanted to make it up to you.

00:00:31.480 --> 00:00:32.313
- What do they do?

00:00:32.313 --> 00:00:34.350
- [Kelly] Well, it's through those doors,

00:00:34.350 --> 00:00:35.183
right up there, can we bring it out?

00:00:35.183 --> 00:00:36.016
- [Kevin] Okay.

00:00:36.016 --> 00:00:36.849
- [Kelly] Yeah!

00:00:36.849 --> 00:00:37.682
- [Kevin] Oh, man, awe!

00:00:39.097 --> 00:00:39.930
Man

00:00:39.930 --> 00:00:41.496
(lively music)

00:00:41.496 --> 00:00:42.329
Man!

00:00:48.106 --> 00:00:49.214
Yeah!

00:00:49.214 --> 00:00:52.432
- So, for everybody that
doesn't know, this is Swoop,

00:00:52.432 --> 00:00:54.075
the mascot of the Philadelphia Eagles.

00:00:54.075 --> 00:00:54.908
(crowd cheers)

00:00:54.908 --> 00:00:56.258
- Good friend of mine.

00:00:56.258 --> 00:00:57.091
- Exactly.

00:00:57.091 --> 00:00:58.150
- Really good friend of mine.

00:00:58.150 --> 00:00:59.920
- And while Swoop can't talk

00:00:59.920 --> 00:01:01.761
because, you know, he is an eagle.

00:01:01.761 --> 00:01:04.120
He came all the way from Philly,

00:01:04.120 --> 00:01:07.450
to bring Kevin Super Bowl cuff links

00:01:07.450 --> 00:01:08.620
and commemorative confetti

00:01:08.620 --> 00:01:09.910
- Oh man!

00:01:09.910 --> 00:01:11.730
- [Kelly] from the post game celebrations.

00:01:11.730 --> 00:01:13.195
- Oh man!

00:01:13.195 --> 00:01:14.028
- [Kelly] Yes!

00:01:14.028 --> 00:01:15.077
- Come on, Swoop!

00:01:15.077 --> 00:01:15.910
Come on!

00:01:17.088 --> 00:01:18.230
- But that's not all

00:01:18.230 --> 00:01:19.126
- What else?

00:01:19.126 --> 00:01:22.250
- Swoop's friends also sent
along a message for Kevin.

00:01:22.250 --> 00:01:23.083
Take a look.

00:01:23.083 --> 00:01:23.916
- [Kevin] Let me see.

00:01:23.916 --> 00:01:25.000
- Hey Kevin, it's Brandon Graham

00:01:25.000 --> 00:01:26.640
with the Philadelphia Eagles.

00:01:26.640 --> 00:01:28.240
Just want to let you know
that we are over here,

00:01:28.240 --> 00:01:29.150
thinking about you.

00:01:29.150 --> 00:01:30.507
And we hope that you're feeling better.

00:01:30.507 --> 00:01:31.340
(audience awws)

00:01:31.340 --> 00:01:33.360
After we heard you was
going on Kelly's show,

00:01:33.360 --> 00:01:34.675
we knew we had to do something.

00:01:34.675 --> 00:01:37.225
So I sent my man Swoop
over to surprise you.

00:01:37.225 --> 00:01:38.380
- Oh

00:01:38.380 --> 00:01:40.200
- We know how big of a Eagles fan you are.

00:01:40.200 --> 00:01:41.033
- Yes, sir.

00:01:41.033 --> 00:01:42.100
- So we sent you a full uniform

00:01:42.100 --> 00:01:43.799
that you can wear on game days.

00:01:43.799 --> 00:01:44.632
- Oh my god

00:01:44.632 --> 00:01:46.591
- By the way, I hope it fits.

00:01:46.591 --> 00:01:47.424
- Let me see.

00:01:47.424 --> 00:01:50.649
- We got your measurements
from the wild docks. (laughs)

00:01:50.649 --> 00:01:52.000
I hope you're feeling better.

00:01:52.000 --> 00:01:53.470
And see you soon.

00:01:53.470 --> 00:01:55.627
Hi Kelly. Go birds.

00:01:55.627 --> 00:01:59.524
(audience claps and cheers)

00:01:59.524 --> 00:02:00.357
- Yeah

00:02:01.807 --> 00:02:02.640
- This is sad, but it's

00:02:02.640 --> 00:02:04.650
- Hey, this is actual
confetti from the game.

00:02:04.650 --> 00:02:06.760
And they signed it, they all signed it.

00:02:06.760 --> 00:02:09.118
- The sad part is that, this is my size.

00:02:09.118 --> 00:02:11.020
(audience laughs)

00:02:11.020 --> 00:02:14.608
I know you guys think
it's a joke, but I'm,

00:02:14.608 --> 00:02:16.780
this is really my size.

00:02:16.780 --> 00:02:19.070
I'm, this is a great thing.

00:02:19.070 --> 00:02:21.020
Hey, I appreciate this, man.

00:02:21.020 --> 00:02:23.210
I know it was tough for
you to get down here.

00:02:23.210 --> 00:02:24.132
You know what, give me, come on, man.

00:02:24.132 --> 00:02:24.965
- Well, he flies, he didn't get

00:02:24.965 --> 00:02:26.709
- Give me some man.

00:02:26.709 --> 00:02:27.626
Ah, always.

